--- HOW TO READ -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  hit  = the full-vocab argmax became the counterpart form. Strict success.
  flip = the pair ordering reversed only. This can be true while the model emits NEITHER
         form, so a high flip beside a low hit means the position was destroyed, not steered.
  alpha (linear)   = multiples of each space's OWN mean-difference norm, so alpha=1 moves a
         point by exactly the marked->unmarked gap in that space. That makes the columns
         comparable across base and latent.
  alpha (centroid) = interpolation fraction toward the target centroid; 1.0 lands on it.

